							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Wow an end of an era.<br /><br /><br />It is always sad to see guilds break up.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />Maybe now Karadana will go out SIDE!&nbsp; Call me toots!
