	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13964"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=321" title="View the profile of Garadan">Garadan</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 45<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/bartmoon.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Fuck you, I know I&#039;m a asshole<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=321"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:GaradanR@netscape.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13964#msg13964"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13964#msg13964">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 08:34:19 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							With my my semi departure from the game the guild kinda lost direction, motivation... not sure which or what. But as we all know or should know RL &gt; EQ. Ascent really only had a handful of old school ascent left in the guild. A few of us either decided to quit the game as well or transfer. The game really lost its fun factor to be honest from my point of view. Once Kinladar lost his cool and went down, shit just got blah.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Whats up Del? Havent heard from you in a few. I will be moving to Germany in October&#039;ish, maybe I can come give you and your other half some drama&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
