							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13964#msg13964">Quote from: Garadan on January 27, 2005, 08:34:19 am</a></div><div class="quote">With my my semi departure from the game the guild kinda lost direction, motivation... not sure which or what. But as we all know or should know RL &gt; EQ. Ascent really only had a handful of old school ascent left in the guild. A few of us either decided to quit the game as well or transfer. The game really lost its fun factor to be honest from my point of view. Once Kinladar lost his cool and went down, shit just got blah.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Whats up Del? Havent heard from you in a few. I will be moving to Germany in October&#039;ish, maybe I can come give you and your other half some drama  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> </div>Octoberfest time I see. What&#039;s up with a move to Germany?<br /><br />Anyway you know where we are. irc.stratics.com #ascent is the heart of the guild, and the games are more or less just extensions of it :P
						</td>
					</tr>
