	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13968"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1016" title="View the profile of impression">impression</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1016"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13968#msg13968"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1395.msg13968#msg13968">Re: Ascent breaking up?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> January 27, 2005, 09:39:06 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Guilds develope a bad rep ALWAYS fall, and in Ascents case this is truly sad. Ascent WAS a class act, and I will never believe they were not. When any guild allows assclowns and jerkyboys into their guild this happens. When a top notched guild allows people like ... drama queens and kings lets just say... that believe it is their God given right to jump over and KS another raid... the guild will eventually fail. Arirang, Warborn, Eastern Circus, and the list goes on, and you know who and what I am saying if you been in EQ long while. Oh ya there were good people in each of these guilds, but when the overall guild&#039;s reputation is a bad one very few will join to keep fresh blood incoming, and most of the ones that do join will be there for a short time only to see the high end of the game knowing they are going to be quitting EQ soonish. Please someone dispute this so we can all see your ignorance. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
